				<wikidot:authorName>Gene R</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>634139</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I hope you forgive me for what I did.<br /> We don't have &quot;12 days of Christmas&quot;. We have &quot;The forest raised a Christmas tree&quot;.<br /> So I remade the whole story into SCP-524 prancing around a SCP-867, which for some reason appeared in SCP-416. Able then uses a SCP-437 to chop said 867 down and brings it to the D-class barracks.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
